{"s":69,"v":[{"t":"The Inevitable Reality -","w":[["ٱلْحَآقَّةُ","The Inevitable Reality","al-ḥāqatu","",[["ٱلْ",2],["حَآقَّةُ",1799]]]]},{"t":"What is the Inevitable Reality?","w":[["مَا","What","mā",""],["ٱلْحَآقَّةُ","(is) the Inevitable Reality","l-ḥāqatu","",[["ٱلْ",2],["حَآقَّةُ",1799]]]]},{"t":"And what can make you know what is the Inevitable Reality?","w":[["وَمَآ","And what","wamā","",[["وَ",1],["مَآ",12]]],["أَدْرَىٰكَ","will make you know","adrāka","",[["أَدْرَىٰ",558],["كَ",18]]],["مَا","what","mā",""],["ٱلْحَآقَّةُ","(is) the Inevitable Reality","l-ḥāqatu","",[["ٱلْ",2],["حَآقَّةُ",1799]]]]},{"t":"Thamūd and ʿAad denied the Striking Calamity [i.e., the Resurrection].","w":[["كَذَّبَتْ","Denied","kadhabat",""],["ثَمُودُ","Thamud","thamūdu",""],["وَعَادٌۢ","and Aad","waʿādun","",[["وَ",1],["عَادٌۢ",377]]],["بِٱلْقَارِعَةِ","the Striking Calamity","bil-qāriʿati","",[["بِ",10],["ٱلْ",2],["قَارِعَةِ",1383]]]]},{"t":"So as for Thamūd, they were destroyed by the overpowering [blast].","w":[["فَأَمَّا","So as for","fa-ammā","",[["فَ",7],["أَمَّا",224]]],["ثَمُودُ","Thamud","thamūdu",""],["فَأُهْلِكُوا۟","they were destroyed","fa-uh'likū","",[["فَ",7],["أُهْلِكُ",239],["وا۟",3]]],["بِٱلطَّاغِيَةِ","by the overpowering (blast)","bil-ṭāghiyati","",[["بِ",10],["ٱل",2],["طَّاغِيَةِ",3808]]]]},{"t":"And as for ʿAad, they were destroyed by a screaming, violent wind","w":[["وَأَمَّا","And as for","wa-ammā","",[["وَ",1],["أَمَّا",224]]],["عَادٌۭ","Aad","ʿādun",""],["فَأُهْلِكُوا۟","they were destroyed","fa-uh'likū","",[["فَ",7],["أُهْلِكُ",239],["وا۟",3]]],["بِرِيحٍۢ","by a wind","birīḥin","",[["بِ",10],["رِيحٍۢ",387]]],["صَرْصَرٍ","screaming","ṣarṣarin",""],["عَاتِيَةٍۢ","violent","ʿātiyatin",""]]},{"t":"Which He [i.e., Allāh] imposed upon them for seven nights and eight days in succession, so you would see the people therein fallen as if they were hollow trunks of palm trees.","w":[["سَخَّرَهَا","Which He imposed","sakharahā","",[["سَخَّرَ",474],["هَا",22]]],